{"surah":104,"ayahs":[{"numberInSurah":1,"arabicText":"وَیْلٌ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٍ لُّمَزَةِۙ","translation":"Woe to every fault-finding backbiter;"},{"numberInSurah":2,"arabicText":"اِ۟لَّذِیْ جَمَعَ مَالًا وَّ عَدَّدَهٗۙ","translation":"who amasses wealth and counts it over and again."},{"numberInSurah":3,"arabicText":"یَحْسَبُ اَنَّ مَالَهٗۤ اَخْلَدَهٗۚ","translation":"He thinks that his wealth will immortalise him forever."},{"numberInSurah":4,"arabicText":"كَلَّا لَیُنْۢبَذَنَّ فِی الْحُطَمَةِ٘ۖ","translation":"Nay, he shall be thrown into the Crusher."},{"numberInSurah":5,"arabicText":"وَ مَاۤ اَدْرٰىكَ مَا الْحُطَمَةُؕ","translation":"And what do you know what the Crusher is?"},{"numberInSurah":6,"arabicText":"نَارُ اللّٰهِ الْمُوْقَدَةُۙ","translation":"It is the Fire kindled by Allah,"},{"numberInSurah":7,"arabicText":"الَّتِیْ تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى الْاَفْئِدَةِؕ","translation":"the Fire that shall rise to the hearts (of criminals)."},{"numberInSurah":8,"arabicText":"اِنَّهَا عَلَیْهِمْ مُّؤْصَدَةٌۙ","translation":"Verily it will close in upon them,"},{"numberInSurah":9,"arabicText":"فِیْ عَمَدٍ مُّمَدَّدَةٍ۠ ۧ","translation":"in outstretched columns."}]}